catflow 0.8
1. Read Text           app.log
2. Split               by=lines
3. Filter              regex="ERROR|FATAL"
4. Dedupe
5. Count               items

6. Join Text   (4)     separator="\n"
7. Summarize           Qwen3 8B; "Group these errors; likely root causes;
                       what to check first"
8. Template    (5,7)   "unique errors: {1}\n\n{2}"
9. Save Text           log-triage.md
